Accept_Agreements_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a call into Agreements is already running
│   └── it should revert with ReentrantCall
├── when the agreement does not exist
│   └── it should revert with InvalidAgreement
├── when the caller is not the payee
│   └── it should revert with NotThePayee
├── when it was already accepted
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyAccepted
├── when the offer was withdrawn or has expired
│   └── it should revert with OfferExpired
├── when the terms hash is not the document hash
│   └── it should revert with TermsMismatch
└── when the payee accepts the exact terms in time
    ├── it should mark the agreement accepted
    ├── given the start date has passed
    │   └── it should start accrual now
    ├── given the start date is in the future
    │   └── it should start accrual at the start date
    └── it should emit AgreementAccepted
